?","audio":{"01":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdullah-Al-Juhany/075036.mp3","02":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdul-Muhsin-Al-Qasim/075036.mp3","03":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdurrahman-as-Sudais/075036.mp3","04":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Ibrahim-Al-Dossari/075036.mp3","05":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Misyari-Rasyid-Al-Afasi/075036.mp3","06":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Yasser-Al-Dosari/075036.mp3"}},{"numberInSurah":37,"arabic":"اَلَمْ يَكُ نُطْفَةً مِّنْ مَّنِيٍّ يُّمْنٰى ","transliteration":"Alam yaku nuṭfatam mim maniyyiy yumnā.","translation":"Bukankah dia dahulu setetes mani yang ditumpahkan (ke dalam rahim)?","audio":{"01":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdullah-Al-Juhany/075037.mp3","02":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdul-Muhsin-Al-Qasim/075037.mp3","03":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdurrahman-as-Sudais/075037.mp3","04":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Ibrahim-Al-Dossari/075037.mp3","05":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Misyari-Rasyid-Al-Afasi/075037.mp3","06":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Yasser-Al-Dosari/075037.mp3"}},{"numberInSurah":38,"arabic":"ثُمَّ كَانَ عَلَقَةً فَخَلَقَ فَسَوّٰىۙ","transliteration":"Ṡumma kāna ‘alaqatan fa khalaqa fa sawwā.","translation":"Kemudian, (mani itu) menjadi sesuatu yang melekat, lalu Dia menciptakan dan menyempurnakannya.","audio":{"01":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdullah-Al-Juhany/075038.mp3","02":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdul-Muhsin-Al-Qasim/075038.mp3","03":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdurrahman-as-Sudais/075038.mp3","04":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Ibrahim-Al-Dossari/075038.mp3","05":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Misyari-Rasyid-Al-Afasi/075038.mp3","06":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Yasser-Al-Dosari/075038.mp3"}},{"numberInSurah":39,"arabic":"فَجَعَلَ مِنْهُ الزَّوْجَيْنِ الذَّكَرَ وَالْاُنْثٰىۗ","transliteration":"Fa ja‘ala minhuz-zaujainiż-żakara wal-unṡā.","translati